# This file no longer configures anything.
#
# atmusic runs as a Cloudflare Worker (docs/adr/0004-cloudflare-workers.md).
# Its settings are Worker vars in worker/wrangler.jsonc and two secrets:
#
# - local development: copy worker/.dev.vars.example to worker/.dev.vars
#   (gitignored) and fill it in; `wrangler dev` reads it;
# - deployed environments: `npx wrangler secret put CURSOR_KEY [--env <env>]`
#   and, optionally, `npx wrangler secret put ADMIN_TOKEN [--env <env>]`.
#
# See docs/deployment.md. The variables of the retired Rust executable
# (bind address, database path, encryption key, metrics token, proxy CIDRs)
# have no Workers equivalent.
